    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18515" root="زيغ" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَائِغٌ</span></b>  <i>Declining, deviating, swerving,</i> or <i>turning
aside:</i> (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَاغَةٌ</span>, applied to a number of
men, (S, O, K, TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَائِغُونَ</span>, (S, O, TA,)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاعَةٌ</span> meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَائِغُونَ</span>. (O, TA.)

